.TH OMACHAT-PROTOCOL 7 "2026-10-01" "OmaChat"
.SH NAME
omachat-protocol \- local IPC and hosted server protocol
.SH DESCRIPTION
Local IPC uses bounded JSON lines over a private same-user Unix socket.
Clients negotiate the version with hello before issuing requests.
The hosted server protocol uses WebSocket, pinned server authentication,
device-key challenges, ordered conversation sequences and idempotent sends.
TLS is required except for numeric-loopback development connections.
The server operator can read message bodies. Local and server storage are sealed at rest.
